                        "text": "var t=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(time-19)/0.45));var s=t<0.6?(t/0.6)*115:115-(t-0.6)/0.4*15;var d=Math.min(1,Math.max(0,(time-39.6)/0.4));s=s*(1-d);var p=0;[25,28,34].forEach(function(t){var u=(time-t)/0.5;if(u>0&&u<1)p=Math.max(p,Math.sin(u*Math.PI));});s=s*(1+0.12*p);[s,s];",
